11	14	2	@ChrisMarasti-Georg: While this is a valid way to look at this, I personally find it confusing when you start thinking which of the normal rankings count and which don't. I prefer to ignore rankings completely and just remember you need 5 distinct low cards.	2012-01-10 19:37:31.42	\N	23
12	10	2	These are all very broad categories.	2012-01-10 19:38:24.85	\N	23
13	3	0	I don't know that I agree with the edit to add 'legally'.  There are several jurisdictions where home games are illegal, and I think  many would consider them a valid option.	2012-01-10 19:41:43.223	\N	17
