16	23	0	Any answer to this question will be situation dependent, and you have not given us a situation more detailed than $1/$2. Is it a Wednesday morning filled with nits, or Friday night with the drunks?	2012-01-10 19:44:44.2	\N	17
17	8	0	Answers shouldn't just be a personal preference, nor a wikipedia link.	2012-01-10 19:44:54.763	\N	4
19	20	4	bet size is not a tell, it's a factor.\nTells are specific, small informations, that can you get to make the best decision in the hand BEYOND the exact informations what you can see anyway.\nand live tells can be faked too...	2012-01-10 19:45:46.263	\N	25
20	29	0	I try to avoid giving much consideration to decision time, as a lag often means simply that someone is multi-tabling. Granted, a FAST decision can imply someone already knows what he wants to do..	2012-01-10 19:46:05.633	\N	31
