331	293	1	It is possible to make a sleeping straddle (as opposed to a live straddle). A sleeping straddle is a straddle made not under the gun and it only stands if no-one has raised the pot before the action reaches the straddler. If someone has raised in front of the player then the straddle is taken back.\n\nThe intention of the sleeping straddle is to stop people from limping in before the straddler - since the straddler has already announced that there is a raise.	2012-01-26 11:43:23.9	\N	221
