727	2	295	0d5813b8-4159-4b5b-ae0d-61258ab7313b	2012-01-25 01:14:56.963	88	\N	\N	No, it is absolutely not rude to leave from UTG. Frankly, it a crazy suggestion. What right does anyone have other than yourself to compel you to spend your own money against your will! From any position, it's still your money. I'd suggest they were the rude one for proposing it.\r\n\r\nNot only is it fine, it's strategically best as it minimizes the cost per hand relative to the blinds, by seeing the whole round.
