1623	5	655	ba31056b-6190-478f-96ad-88c2e248bc28	2012-05-19 12:11:52.617	309	\N	added 91 characters in body	Given the fact that you said "effective stack 80 % max buy-in", I'll assume this is a cash game we're talking about, not a tournament.\r\n\r\nIf villain has about the same stack as you, I think the all-in move is not a mistake. Even if he has an Ace or if he hits a set on the flop, you say he will still fold. In the worst case (a.k.a if he calls and wins), you will still be winning in the long run.
