1633	2	660	0547555f-0ced-4c14-b2c9-38aee219178a	2012-05-23 18:32:23.233	214	\N	\N	When a game is played like the money isn't real, your best bet with big hands is "shove and pray."\r\n\r\nA +EV strategy in these microlimits is to over-raise with AA, KK, QQ, and AK and try to limp into any single raiser in late position with pairs and big aces. It manages to be both boring and highly volatile at the same time, but it will make money over time.
