2109	5	853	42d2b714-6377-48c2-9027-25d756127779	2012-10-13 03:01:43.317	631	\N	added 253 characters in body	I'd put him on T9, 98, A9, K9, Q9.  Its a blind battle and hes going to be calling down light and trapping.  J9/Q9,97 should prolly be weighted at 50ish% since he might not get here/do that with these weaker 9s.  TT,99,88 essentially never gets here.\r\n \r\n24 combos you win...\r\n\r\n    A9-8\r\n    K9-8\r\n    Q9-4\r\n    J9-3\r\n    97-1\r\n\r\n12 combos you lose...\r\n\r\n    T9-6\r\n    98-6\r\n\r\nYou should win 66% of the time.  You would still have pot odds to call if he had only T9,98,A9 :D
