3044	2	1197	8fa1a897-a76c-41a6-a030-d02390c116d6	2013-03-08 21:40:32.4	819	\N	\N	The betting behavior of players does not affect the the order in which action takes place in later betting rounds.  When new community cards are dealt (flop, turn and river), the new betting round starts with the first player left of the dealer, if he/she hasn't fold in the previous betting round.  In the examples you give, nobody folds so this would be the small blind.
