3181	2	1244	a464bdf4-6dca-4db5-b5e0-ece6a7045bb6	2013-03-25 22:23:55.597	852	\N	\N	The "D" i short for "dealer button" and its used to keep track of where the big blind and small blind is to be placed. In your case the small blind 1$ and the big blind is 2$ and these are forced bets.\r\n\r\nThe terms you asking about is just names. But you have terms in poker like \r\n\r\nShark = Very good player\r\nDonk = Super bad player\r\nFish = Super bad player
