5774	5	2889	c1a4ac26-93bd-4e4c-a197-a2db0caf12e3	2014-04-17 22:34:58.103	1431	\N	added 73 characters in body	A1 is the small blind and B2 is the big blind. The F6 seat is the button, even though it's empty, as it would have been the button had the players stayed — it's a dead button. We can't skip having A1 as the small blind — that would just be giving him a discount. G7 and H8 can't come into a game in the middle of the blinds so they'll have to wait to play until the next hand when A1 is the button. \r\n\r\n
