7375	2	4128	702fd74d-eae6-4f4f-843a-8b7680bef8fd	2014-08-02 22:43:36.407	1639	\N	\N	The other day I was playing a game where I was playing relatively conservatively, waiting for a good hand.  Then I got a pair of aces, and as soon as I bet just a couple of chips, everybody immediately folded, so I wasn't really able to capitalize on it.\r\n\r\nWhat's the best way to play in this situation?\r\n
