8123	2	4421	36986718-e5f5-482e-b4c4-45dea73b14fe	2014-12-15 00:55:14.133	1896	\N	\N	Based on your calculations... If you hold 4 cards (A to 4), you will ALWAYS make a pair?\r\n\r\nEstimate with 3/50 * 5 instead of the annoyingly similar fractions:\r\n(3/50 * 5) * 4 = 60/50 !?\r\n\r\nObviously, there's something off with your math. Try again and I will help you get to the right answer together.\r\n\r\nI am glad you are looking into the math as the majority of the amateurs or wannabes thinks the game is all about reads and buffs. Most Pros don't even have the real math down (they have rudimentary understanding of common odds but not in depth decision tree analysis that some of the more mathematical pros do).
