8259	2	4472	e171b5e2-a052-4d69-859f-541482076ba4	2014-12-31 03:48:58.367	1762	\N	\N	You are not obliged automatically. It is common that someone bluffs, gets called and they muck the hand, and that is not against the rules. However the calling player can ask to see the hand and the request obligates the dealer to turn up the hand, if the hand is still available to turn up. 
