lly optimal strategy for heads-up limit hold'em, and it can play against either of them, or any human or other program, and be guaranteed to not lose.  We're @PolarisPoker on twitter - we mostly use that for posting links to new papers that we publish.\r\n\r\n  [2]: http://webdocs.cs.ualberta.ca/~johanson/publications/poker/2015-science-hulhe/2015-science-hulhe.html\r\n  [3]: http://webdocs.cs.ualberta.ca/~games/poker/cfr_plus.html
