9780	2	5691	67f7337e-a1c2-4267-bc07-9c61bbbdb8c0	2015-02-19 03:06:05.547	1048	\N	\N	This is called "rabbit hunting," or just "rabbiting." Many casinos and card rooms explicitly prohibit it in their "rules and regulations" document ([example](http://www.thebike.com/poker/rules-instructions)). If you want to try your luck with asking individual dealers to bend the rules... well, do so at your own risk. For home games, there's no single definitive rule about whether rabbiting is allowed or prohibited. You can set the house rule either way. Just make sure everyone knows what it is ahead of time.
