10241	2	5846	c00f09d1-e5a0-415f-bca4-9d9ddcdc018a	2015-04-16 23:29:18.933	1554	\N	\N	There are two reason why short stacking doesn't work, and is generally frowned upon by advanced players.\r\n\r\n 1. You usually pay much more rake. For instance, at a $0.5/$1 table at pokerstars, the rake is 4.5% with a cap of $1,50. So in a pot for $200, the rake will only be 0.75%. In a pot of $40, the rake is 3.75%.\r\n\r\n 2. It increases the luck factor. With a shortstack you have less decisions and much easier decisions. Therefore it's hard to gain an edge on others by making better decisions.\r\n\r\n
