epresent an Ace against Mike's pocket kings, he splits an Oreo *while looking at it* instead:\r\n\r\n[![enter image description here][3]][3]\r\n\r\nWhat is Teddy KGB's tell? Is it indeed that he listens to the sound of the Oreo splitting when he holds a strong hand?\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: http://i.stack.imgur.com/Ilesn.jpg\r\n  [2]: http://i.stack.imgur.com/1gVFD.png\r\n  [3]: http://i.stack.imgur.com/haKa1.png
