11555	5	6348	211ed366-2cd1-4c84-89f1-914dcda58293	2015-10-21 10:46:37.557	\N	user1165	added 460 characters in body	Three of a kind is a made hand, consist of three (3) cards of the same rank. A player has a Three of a kind if the board cards, plus his own hole cards have 3 cards of the same rank. If only the board has 3 cards of the same rank, we say that all active players have (at least) a Three of a Kind. A stronger variant of Three of a kind hand is called Set, which occurs when the player have a pair and a 3rd card of the same rank shows on board (eg. 88 on a 8KA)
