ne call behind you on min raise from UTG the board comes up KQ4.  You would still lose 14% of the time.  Post flop you would need to get $300 more dollars in the pot for proper odds on your initial min raise bet and there are very few hands that would call (or bet) $300 that you would beat.\r\n\r\nLate position really changes things as you don't risk the raise and if you hit you can extract more money.\r\n
