12321	5	6643	dc0b84e1-3c1c-4757-b45b-e4c2eb62a4ea	2016-01-19 16:18:16.49	3876	\N	added 216 characters in body	It aint over till the river.   If T9 suited come up then you lose to a straight flush.  \r\n\r\nOtherwise you win with a higher flush.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen it is part of made part of the hand you don't call it a kicker. It is an ace high flush or king high straight.  When the made part is not 5 cards then you have a kicker - pair of queens with an ace kicker.
12322	5	6643	a98a6639-3646-406b-abd3-eb0b749d2ddb	2016-01-19 16:47:55.733	3876	\N	added 123 characters in body	It aint over till the river.   If T9 suited come up then you lose to a straight flush.  \r\n\r\nOtherwise you win with a higher flush.  An ace high flush is called the nut flush.  But it would still lose to a full house, four or a kind, or a straight flush.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen it is part of made part of the hand you don't call it a kicker. It is an ace high flush or king high straight.  When the made part is not 5 cards then you have a kicker - pair of queens with an ace kicker.
