12943	5	6850	2021135b-f7a2-4380-8d79-215c86698b4a	2016-03-21 20:51:32.37	3876	\N	added 173 characters in body	The odds of you getting a boat are [2.60%][1]  \r\nBut that number is high as you can only get quaded if the boat has a set  \r\nIf you are using the pair on the board to make the trips then there are not two left to quad  \r\n\r\nFrom the boat there are 45 cards out (52 - 2 - 5)  \r\nThe only way for you to get quaded is for the other hand to match the pair on the boat    \r\nSo the odds of getting quadded are:  \r\n[(2/2) / (45/2)][2] = 0.00101 = 0.1%  \r\nWhich also = 2/45 * 1/44\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poker_probability\r\n  [2]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combination
