12965	2	6855	0c37c594-350d-4925-bd06-0ff2ca151974	2016-03-24 20:40:09.99	3876	\N	\N	A wild card would totally mess with the odds  \r\n\r\nTwo pair would go from 4 outs to 5    \r\n5/4 \r\n\r\nA flush draw would go from 9 to 10  \r\n10/9   \r\nNot only that the wild card is killed by the boat   \r\nSo flush still only has 9 outs versus 2 pair or trips (any hand to be afraid of)   \r\n\r\nTrips **double** the outs    \r\n\r\nIt would mess with the game in very bad way  \r\n\r\nOld flush   \r\nc(13,5) 4 / c(52,5) =  503.85 : 1  \r\n\r\nNew flush   \r\nc(14,5) 4 / c(53,5) = 357.35 : 1 \r\n\r\nOld boat   \r\nc(4,3) 13 c(12,2) 12 / c(52,5) = 693.17 : 1  \r\n\r\nNew boat   \r\nc(5,3) 13 c(12,2) 12 / c(53,5) = 305.59 : 1\r\n\r\nWith wild card a flush is harder to hit than a boat   \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n
