red!  This is hard to deal with because I have a hard time of raising much on KK.\r\n\r\nSo my point here isn't that WSOP is cheating people or whatever.  It is just really apparent that the cards aren't random.  It seems that they have some prescribed formulas to bump the action.  Are there pay sites that use more sophisticated prescribed hands (not rigged), are there lists of sites with known rigged games, and if so does anyone have data on if there is any favoritism of players?
