14527	2	8055	a7b2a8e4-6d06-4beb-94be-dc1a977b8461	2016-06-26 14:35:44.513	3876	\N	\N	It matters.  Assume 6 player sit down at an 8 player table starting at the button.   \r\n\r\nIf I am #6 I want to know if the other 5 are going to sit and wait for the BB. If they are going to wait then so am I.  It is silly to pay a BB to come in on the button when the button is the next hand.   \r\n\r\nThe most fair way is starting at the button and going clockwise have the player declare if they are in or not.  \r\n\r\nPlayer 1 knows where they are relative to the BB.  But player 2+ does not know until the player in front of them declare.
