14747	2	8125	4a19876a-868a-442a-8540-be05e351aa0c	2016-07-27 10:30:44.577	1456	\N	\N	This is my main weakness in poker. The rest can be learnt over time but when it comes down to making tough decisions, you gotta stick to what you know about your opponent. So this question is what exactly should you remember/take in notes about your opponents. What should you look for when observing the table. Some suggest to filter the players into types: LAG, TAG, Call station,etc... is that enough to be profitable? Should you look for more specific weaknesses? If yes, what should you look for? \r\n\r\nAlso, generally, how can one improve this skill?  
