14750	2	8126	d76d5df1-3630-4a27-b923-c29bd70f9b7f	2016-07-27 13:20:11.8	3876	\N	\N	Range including bluffs.  Based on position and bets / raises what is their range.  Some player will only open in early with JJ+ AKs and some will open any pair or ATs+.  Some will call in middle with mid suited connectors.  Every time they show remember what they did pre flop and make mental or physical note.  When you get in a spot with them then range them and compare their range plus the board to your hand.\r\n\r\nUse a HUD so you can get used to what it tracks and what information helps you.\r\n\r\nCheck out [Alec Torelli][1]. He does a nice job of talking about ranging.\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: http://alectorelli
