14773	2	8136	d479b1bf-3103-4224-9826-90af8c49ce09	2016-07-29 00:17:56.093	3876	\N	\N	I don't come to that same answer and that number seems high to me.  The chance of a straight flush is 72,192:1 and three pocket pairs seems harder to make than a straight flush.  The chance of 4 of a kind is 4,164:1 and that seems way more remote than 4 of a kind.\r\n\r\nusing combinations  \r\n\r\nnumber of 2 card combinations = combin(52,2) = 1326  \r\nnumber of way to take three hands = combin(1326, 3) = 387,700,300     \r\nnumber pairs for each rank = combin(4,2) = 6    \r\nnumber of rank = 13   \r\n6 * 13 / 387,700,300 = 0.000000201 = 49,706 : 1\r\n\r\n
14774	5	8136	961aaf0d-5996-4739-a4b3-18dd4043645d	2016-07-29 00:26:42.483	3876	\N	added 69 characters in body	I don't come to that same answer and that number seems high to me.  The chance of a straight flush is 72,192:1 and three pocket pairs seems harder to make than a straight flush.  The chance of 4 of a kind is 4,164:1 and that seems way more remote than 4 of a kind.\r\n\r\nusing combinations  \r\n\r\nnumber of 2 card combinations = combin(52,2) = 1326  \r\nnumber of way to take three hands = combin(1326, 3) = 387,700,300     \r\nnumber pairs for each rank = combin(4,2) = 6    \r\nnumber of rank = 13   \r\n6 * 13 / 387,700,300 = 0.000000201 = 49,706 : 1\r\n\r\nfor a single pair   \r\n6 * 13 / 1326 = 1/51 = 0.058823529 = 18 : 1  \r\n
