14783	2	8139	9d332a57-5ce9-40bd-8c8f-011c5c915fb0	2016-07-30 11:04:41.18	3876	\N	\N	Some tables just over bet.  Wait for your spot.  When you hit trips you are going to get paid off big.  \r\n\r\nYou also have two overs. So unless they have 2 pair or trips you have 10 outs. \r\nYour pot odd are 23/9 = 2.6 and hand odd (52-5-10)/10 = 3.7.  You are not getting immediate odds to call.\r\n\r\nYou also have implied odds. If you think you can get more bets when you hit then it may be profitable.
