15130	2	8254	a83fd745-fe3a-4b63-8e78-c3e7be62d2d0	2016-09-18 15:45:31.39	3876	\N	\N	There was a question here about PlayWSOP was rigged so I got and account to see if I say anything to confirm.  I saw no evidence it was rigged.  Put that is how most of the low (play) money games are played.   \r\n\r\nWhen the table is loose then play tight.  If you get a lot of post flop callers then you can play some good draws and you can get good payouts.  \r\n\r\nPosition does not matter as much but it still matters.\r\n\r\nFor sure play AA, KK, AK, QQ can raise to build the pot.  But if you don't hit a  and you have 6 in the pot with wet board then play it slow.  Fold if it gets too expensive.\r\n\r\nI will flat call in mid to late with with any pair or suited connects 6 or above.  If you hit then punish if not get away.  If you have 8+ outs you are probably going to get immediate pots odds to call.  \r\n\r\nYou can typically win against a table like this but the frustration is that it can take a while.
