16113	5	8585	d319f9f9-227c-4716-9265-4994fac6fbf3	2017-01-04 12:01:23.18	3876	\N	added 166 characters in body	My read is villain was happy to let you build the pot.  You slowed down and villain put you on exactly the hand you had and wants to shut it down.  You have 10 outs.\r\n\r\nI don't get the re-raise to 5.0M pre flop.  What do you think you are ahead of?   Call and hope for a jack.  You are deep stacked.  Short stacked you should have just folded.\r\n\r\nYou got yourself in a bad spot with an inflated pot but why would you shut down on turn. You improved to straight draw. If villain had QQ you were already behind.\r\n\r\n
