16133	2	8590	9856c408-2919-4db2-9788-b85c5e0d04e5	2017-01-05 23:48:12.077	3816	\N	\N	A coin flip is when the chances of either hand winning are about 50%, the same as a coin flip coming up heads or tails. Most players consider anything in the range of 45-55% as being a coin flip, rather than exactly 50%.
