16249	2	8614	e180ecb5-ace1-4e71-bd93-d3f69d50888c	2017-01-13 07:18:03.507	4771	\N	\N	Board: `J J J 4 4`\n\nPlayer 1: `6 6`\n\nPlayer 2: `4 8`\n\nPlayer 1's best hand is `J J J 6 6` (Full house, Jacks full of Sixes)\n\nPlayer 2's best hand is `J J J 4 4` (Full house, Jacks full of Fours)\n\nTherefore, **Player 1 wins**.\n\nYou could have answered this question yourself by reading [How to determine the winning hands in poker?](http://poker.stackexchange.com/questions/6680/how-to-determine-the-winning-hands-in-poker) - this question will probably be closed as a duplicate of that question.
