16311	2	8633	5da301dd-a4e6-4025-a726-d78d33ae9021	2017-01-18 16:27:41.22	\N	user1934	\N	The top hand (babr86) wins, as the best poker hand that 9&clubs; 5&hearts; can make with the board is \r\n\r\nA&clubs; 9&clubs; 7&clubs; 5&clubs; 3&clubs;\r\n\r\nWhereas the K&spades; 7&spades; hand is playing the board:\r\n\r\nA&clubs; 7&clubs; 5&clubs; 3&clubs; 2&clubs;\r\n\r\nGiving the top hand a better kicker in the second card.\r\n\r\nAlso note that the second player's 7&spades; which forms a pair with the board does not factor into their final hand, as a flush is better than a pair.\r\n
