16395	2	8661	3fb4b760-2e05-4f05-9b61-9dd3ecf6bf76	2017-01-23 07:02:27.323	4771	\N	\N	You've been counterfeited on the river.\n\nVillain's best hand is: Q&hearts; Q&spades; 6&hearts; 6&clubs; J&diamond; (*two pair, Queens and Sixes, Jack kicker*)\n\nYour best hand is: Q&hearts; Q&spades; 6&hearts; 6&clubs; 8&hearts; (*two pair, Queens and Sixes, Eight kicker*)\n\nTherefore, your pair of fives is irrelevant as it doesn't form part of your best hand, which cannot beat your opponent's best hand and so you lose at showdown.
