17629	2	9015	01202c23-10b4-47ea-9e9e-a74830859deb	2017-06-12 07:33:37.357	5050	\N	\N	The minimum **bet** size is one big blind. This bet is therefore legal.\n\nThe minimum **raise** size is the amount you would have to call times 2. Therefore a minimum bet preflop in this instance would be 100 x 2 = 200.\n\nThese rules apply always.
