18107	2	9166	7cec1d00-5a57-4216-a819-091d940baa32	2017-07-20 16:54:27.747	3876	\N	\N	I just ran the numbers and thought it was worth posting  \r\n\r\nUsing [Combination][1]\r\n\r\nflop combin(50, 3) = 19600\r\n\r\n3 flush combin(11, 3) = 165 / 19600 = 0.0084183673 = 0.84% = 1/119\r\n\r\n3 flush combin(11, 2) = 55\r\nother cards = 48\r\n48 * 55 / 19600 = 0.1346938776 = 13% = 1 / 7.4 \r\n\r\nflush or 4 flush = 0.0084183673 + 0.1346938776 = 0.1431122449 = 14% = 1 / 7 \r\n\r\n4 flush hit on the turn = 9 / 47 = 0.1914893617 = 19% = 1 / 5.22\r\n\r\n4 flush hit on the river = 8 / 46 = 0.1956521739 = 20% = 1 / 5.11 \r\n\r\nflush hit on turn or river or both  \r\n( 9 flush x 47 other card + combine(9, 2) ) / combin(47, 2) = 0.3496762257 = 35% = 1 / 2.9\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combination
