18224	2	9202	257c284a-3253-4c4a-8995-a4e174db122b	2017-08-07 16:23:21.413	3876	\N	\N	How to calculate poker odds using [combinations][1]? \r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combination
18229	5	9203	72d68172-3590-45b7-98a8-61b2bf7eb501	2017-08-07 17:26:05.523	3876	\N	added 5 characters in body	I got tired of explaining [combination][1] in answers so just making one post.\r\n\r\nWith multiple cards simple fractions don't work.  \r\n\r\nCombination is how many ways you can make the combination.  \r\nLike 52 take 5 or 52 take 2  \r\n\r\nIn Excel it is combin(n, k) \r\n\r\nHow many possible hole cards combin(52, 2) = 1326\r\n  \r\nOn the river you opponent can have combin(45, 2) = 990\r\n\r\nOdd of a pocket pair  \r\n13 rank * combin(52, 2) / 1326 = 1 / 17 \r\n\r\nSuited   \r\n4 * combin(13, 2) / 1326 = 4.25  \r\n\r\nAbove you can do with fraction but from a pair chance to hit quads   \r\nquad is 1 way   \r\nthen 3 cards from 48   \r\ncombin(48, 3) / combin(50, 5) = 1 / 122.5\r\n\r\ntrips or better from pair   \r\ncombin(2, 1) * combin(48, 4) / combin(50, 5) = 1 / 5.4444444444\r\n\r\nfor [more][2] \r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combination\r\n  [2]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poker_probability
18230	5	9203	194ba230-1a99-4599-9a08-98aba4f5355c	2017-08-07 18:19:09.743	3876	\N	added 1 character in body	I got tired of explaining [combination][1] in answers so just making one post.\r\n\r\nWith multiple cards simple fractions don't work.  \r\n\r\nCombination is how many ways you can make the combination.  \r\nLike 52 take 5 or 52 take 2  \r\n\r\nIn Excel it is combin(n, k) \r\n\r\nHow many possible hole cards combin(52, 2) = 1326\r\n  \r\nOn the river your opponent can have combin(45, 2) = 990\r\n\r\nOdds of a pocket pair  \r\n13 rank * combin(4, 2) / 1326 = 1 / 17 \r\n\r\nSuited   \r\n4 * combin(13, 2) / 1326 = 4.25  \r\n\r\nAbove you can do with fraction but from a pair chance to hit quads   \r\nquad is 1 way   \r\nthen 3 cards from 48   \r\ncombin(48, 3) / combin(50, 5) = 1 / 122.5\r\n\r\ntrips or better from pair   \r\ncombin(2, 1) * combin(48, 4) / combin(50, 5) = 1 / 5.4444444444\r\n\r\nfor [more][2] \r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combination\r\n  [2]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poker_probability
18231	2	9204	34cc7af1-5b83-47b7-a1d1-2da3719ec137	2017-08-07 20:56:08.527	3876	\N	\N	**Pre**  \r\nDid you initially just call. Call the raise is questionable but you had position and and can hit a nutted level hand. \r\n\r\n\r\n**Flop**    \r\n8 outs to straight.  Runner JJ, QQ, JQ is probably good so give yourself 1 more out.  No way you can rep JJ as you should have raised pre.\r\n\r\nHand odds (45-9)/9 = 4.2\r\n \r\nPot odds 95 / 25 =  3.8\r\n\r\nHand odds > pot odds so it not a call but close.  I you can get another bet in if you hit then it is a call.\r\n\r\n**Turn**   \r\nTurn you pick up 2 more outs so your hands odds = 3.6 and pot odd 4.4 so call.\r\n\r\n**River**   \r\nSurprised a set just checked.  \r\n\r\n
