18574	2	9325	5e224a69-f24c-4b57-b0ff-082134c22782	2017-09-17 11:16:46.81	5050	\N	\N	If you late register, all pots you play will be much more significant, compared to pots you play in the earlier stages of the game. Players can opt to late register, because playing the earlier stages is simply not worth their time. Their hourly rate is higher when they late register.\r\n\r\nAnother reason is, some players like to gamble. They prefer short-stacked poker and don't really care if it is sub optimal. Or they just randomly registered for some tournaments, where some of them happen to be in their later stages.\r\n
