19579	2	9661	73be0239-4614-4704-b46e-d0c08977d933	2018-02-17 17:19:38.93	3876	\N	\N	This is from Conscious Poker hand of the day on you tube.  To me it is a fascinating hand.  \r\n\r\nNLHE $5, $10 nine handed  \r\n\r\n**Pre flop**   \r\nHero is in the SB with a stack of $300 with J&diamond;T&spades;    \r\nThree limps (plus BB) to the hero hero who bumps it to $60  \r\nUTG+1 calls and Btn calls  \r\n\r\n**Flop**  \r\nPot $200  \r\nJ&spades;8&clubs;3&hearts;  \r\nSB (hero) checks  \r\nUTG+1 checks   \r\nBtn (villain) bets $49.25 ($3000 behind)  \r\nUTG+1 folds  \r\nHero calls  \r\n\r\n**Turn**   \r\nPot $298.50    \r\n3&hearts;  \r\nHero check  \r\nVillain bets $73.87     \r\nHero calls   \r\n\r\n**River**    \r\nPot $446.25   \r\n8&spades;    \r\nHero checks    \r\nVillain **jams** for $2816.88   \r\nHero folds    \r\nVillain shows A&spades;K&diamond;\r\n\r\n
