19887	2	9779	2013bf60-c2de-4dd2-978c-f56da810abbc	2018-03-27 15:56:33.687	3876	\N	\N	More complex then you would think.\r\n\r\nBoard has no other hearts  \r\n\r\n+3 x combin(39; 2) / combin(50; 5) = 3 x 741 / 2118760 = 0.00105 = 1 / 953  \r\n\r\nBut the board could also be a 4 hearts   8&hearts; 9&hearts; T&hearts; K&hearts; which steels your Q high flush but gives you another way to make it.  You cannot just change the the 39 to 50 as it is double dipping.  So the odds are very slightly better than the number above.\r\n
