19918	2	9788	c5c3e6eb-d2c6-446f-bfc9-014c7fbbb6db	2018-04-01 16:47:16.303	3876	\N	\N	If Player A called Player B then Player B was last aggressor.  \r\n\r\nLast aggressor (Player B) is obligated to show first.  \r\n\r\nIn most rooms Player A is NOT required to show.  It would not make since to have an order to show if all players had to show anyway.\r\n\r\nIf Player A showed first (out of order) is Player B required to show is more interesting. In most rooms Player B would be required to show. But Player A could have just waited for Player B to show first if s/he wanted to see.
