20471	2	9954	0abd5a26-fbdc-43a9-a0e3-61e4ca60debd	2018-06-30 09:08:18.67	5050	\N	\N	What hands on average makes the most money? It is of course just AA, KK, QQ. They just make the most money, since they have the highest equity. True, sometimes you smash the flop with a suited connector and take down a huge pot, but most of the time you miss. On average you will still be a lot worse off with a suited connector than aces. The reason you sometimes lose a huge pot with a big overpair, is that with a big overpair you want to play big pots, and in poker sometimes you lose. Note that when playing deepstacked the relative value of some of the suited connectors go up, but are still nowhere near the value of aces.
