20615	2	10010	0f27874a-5778-471c-86db-0eb1ad29cbaf	2018-07-25 11:22:11.973	6099	\N	\N	Assuming the situation is that both players are all in on the trun.\r\n\r\n 1. A tie will happen if the river is a Q(2 outs) or a 6(3 outs) = 5 outs\r\n 2. KQ will win if river is a K (3 outs) \r\n 3. Remaining cards is deck = 44\r\n\r\nSo the % are\r\n\r\n    % win KQ = 3/44 * 100 = 6.8%\r\n    % tie = 5/44 * 100 = 11.4%\r\n    % win AQ = 100 - 6.8 - 11.4 = 81.8%\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n
