d call, check, and previous play, I have no idea what to do. So what would you do?\r\n\r\nSpoiler alert, I decided to call, and rivered a straight to her A6o (two pair). I got next to nothing from table talk while deciding, other than she seemed worried. Minimal room to improve and I knew I needed to. Told her I had A10 and could swear I saw her sweating. 
