601	2	\N	594	2012-04-21 20:43:25.983	\N	4	\N	<p>I have something that I call the Q-T-8 standard. Among starting hands, no unsuited hands where the lower card is lower than a Q (that is A-Q and K-Q only), no suited hands where the lower card is less than a ten (that is down to J-T), and no pairs lower than 8s.</p>\n	217	\N	\N	\N	\N	2012-04-21 20:43:25.983	\N	\N	\N	5	\N	\N	\N
