2795	5	\N	\N	2014-03-13 10:08:40.24	\N	0	\N	<p>In pot limit poker games, a player can not bet more than the total amount currently in the pot.</p>\n\n<p>The most popular Pot-Limit poker variants are Pot-Limit Hold'em and Pot-Limit Omaha. The Pot-Limit limitation can be applied to any poker variant, of course, but it's rarely done, especially when it comes to Stud or Draw games (which usually use "Limit" as their pot limitation).</p>\n	309	\N	309	\N	2014-03-13 10:08:40.24	2014-03-13 10:08:40.24	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N
