2797	5	\N	\N	2014-03-13 10:15:24.59	\N	0	\N	<p>Any type of resource or activity can be qualified as "learning", up to and including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>reading books</li>\n<li>learning how to quickly calculate all kinds of outs and odds</li>\n<li>playing a lot of hands online</li>\n<li>memorizing starting hands tables</li>\n<li>improving opponent reading skills</li>\n<li>learning to recognize both live and online tells</li>\n</ul>\n	309	\N	309	\N	2014-03-13 10:15:24.59	2014-03-13 10:15:24.59	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N
