4126	2	\N	4120	2014-07-31 15:53:53.283	\N	3	\N	<p>Example:</p>\n\n<p>You have A2, villain has A3.</p>\n\n<p>Board is: 24567.</p>\n\n<p>That gives you a low: A2456</p>\n\n<p>Gives villain low: A2345</p>\n\n<p>Basically, whenever one of your cards pairs, you <b>might</b> be in danger.</p>\n	1319	\N	\N	\N	\N	2014-07-31 15:53:53.283	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N
