6065	1	\N	\N	2015-07-11 21:06:37.75	\N	1	38	<p>I had a problem figuring out the split pot rule the other night, this is the scenario:</p>\n\n<p>I had: 10, 3\nMy Buddy Had: 10, 5\nThe Table: K, Q, J, 8, 7</p>\n\n<p>Should the pot be split because we both had the same best five cards? (K, Q, J, 10, 8)</p>\n\n<p>Or did my buddy win because he had a higher kicker?</p>\n	3469	\N	\N	\N	\N	2015-07-11 21:06:37.75	What is the“Top Five Cards” rule and how does it apply to splitting pots?	<texas-hold-em>	0	1	\N	2015-07-13 06:52:54.113	\N
