6178	2	\N	6166	2015-08-20 20:18:29.06	\N	0	\N	<p>Actually, most of the time the dealer will skip the new player if they come in and they have to wait until the button gets to them. (This is to avoid making the same player pay the BB twice in a row) In that case, it doesn't matter at all which seat they pick. In this case, I believe they would be in the position to get the button in 2 hands, so they would only have to sit out for one.</p>\n	3574	\N	\N	\N	\N	2015-08-20 20:18:29.06	\N	\N	\N	4	\N	\N	\N
