8272	2	\N	8270	2016-09-27 09:03:19.533	\N	6	\N	<p>Assuming this is No Limit Hold'em, his K&hearts; will beat your 9&hearts;. </p>\n\n<p>He has a K&hearts;J&hearts;T&hearts;6&hearts;4&hearts; flush<br>\nyou have a J&hearts;T&hearts;9&hearts;6&hearts;5&hearts; flush  </p>\n\n<p>As Herb's link points out, your hand is the best 5 of the 7 cards in your hand and the board - it makes no difference whether you use 0, 1 or 2 of your hole cards. </p>\n	4598	\N	3876	\N	2016-09-28 14:17:01.82	2016-09-28 14:17:01.82	\N	\N	\N	1	\N	\N	\N
