8287	2	\N	8286	2016-10-09 17:39:39.287	\N	1	\N	<p>Look up dead button rule </p>\n\n<pre><code>1     2    3    4     5\nbnt   sb   bb   utg   utg+1\n\nco    btn  xx   sb    bb      opt A\n\nco    btn  sb   bb            opt B\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>The problem with opt A is 4 does not pay a big blind<br>\nWith opt B there is no sb paid    </p>\n\n<p>Option B - just post a BB is the common approach</p>\n\n<p><a href="http://www.homepokertourney.com/button.htm" rel="nofollow">dead button</a></p>\n	3876	\N	3876	\N	2016-10-09 21:46:36.783	2016-10-09 21:46:36.783	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N
