8596	1	8597	\N	2017-01-08 22:17:40.603	\N	1	126	<p>When you're sitting at a cash table at a casino and you're ready to leave, is it bad etiquette to wait until you're about to be in the big blind and then walk? This obviously makes the most sense because you may as well sit and see some free cards.\nI've always done this, but last time I was at a new poker room, I got a couple of snide comments for pulling this.\nSo what's the consensus among you guys?</p>\n	4461	\N	4771	\N	2017-01-08 23:32:56.763	2017-01-09 10:20:57.213	Bad Etiquette or Smart Poker?	<cash-game><etiquette><casino>	2	2	0	2017-01-09 09:08:50.477	\N
