1020	101	2013-08-07 02:33:31.213	Tony Huynh	2013-08-26 21:23:27.083	https://sites.google.com/site/matroidintersection/home	Brussels, Belgium	<p>I am currently a postdoc at <a href="http://www.ulb.ac.be/facs/sciences/math/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\n Université Libre de Bruxelles</a> working with <a href="http://homepages.ulb.ac.be/~sfiorini/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Samuel Fiorini</a>. Previously, I have spent time at <a href="http://www.di.uniroma1.it/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Sapienza Università di Roma</a> with <a href="http://wwwusers.di.uniroma1.it/~wollan/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Paul Wollan</a>, at <a href="http://www.math.sfu.ca/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Simon Fraser University</a> with <a href="http://people.math.sfu.ca/~goddyn/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Luis Goddyn</a> and <a href="http://www.sfu.ca/~mdevos/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Matt\nDeVos</a>, at <a href="http://mathsci.kaist.ac.kr/home/en/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\nKAIST</a> with \n<a href="http://mathsci.kaist.ac.kr/~sangil/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\nSang-il Oum</a>, and at <a href="http://www.cwi.nl" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\nCWI Amsterdam</a> and <a href="http://www.maastrichtuniversity.nl/web/Faculties/SBE/Theme/Departments/QuantitativeEconomics.htm" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\nMaastricht University</a> with  <a href="https://www.cwi.nl/people/452" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\nBert Gerards</a>.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nI completed my PhD in the <a href="http://www.math.uwaterloo.ca/co/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\nDepartment of Combinatorics and Optimization</a> at the University of Waterloo. My supervisor was <a href="http://www.math.uwaterloo.ca/~jfgeelen/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">\nJim Geelen</a>.  I am mainly interested in graphs, matroids, and combinatorial optimization, but I enjoy dabbling in other areas as well.  I also write for <a href="http://matroidunion.org/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">The Matroid Union Blog</a>.\n</p>\n	0	1	0	https://i.stack.imgur.com/0YXo0.jpg?s=128&g=1	\N	\N	510301
