3454	101	2015-07-04 04:25:12.997	Aloizio Macedo	2017-08-02 02:28:39.487	http://im.ufrj.br/~aloizio/	Rio de Janeiro, Brazil	<p>Happy <strong>new year</strong>!</p>\n\n<p>I am a graduate student at UFRJ (Universidade Federal do Rio de Janeiro). You can see my webpage on IM-UFRJ <a href="http://im.ufrj.br/~aloizio/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">here</a>.</p>\n\n<p>My area is Geometry and Topology. Specifically, I studied the free loop space of globally symmetric spaces and its homology in the specific case of CROSS's (Compact Rank One Symmetric Spaces) in my MSc. Today, I am leaning towards symplectic topology and Floer homology, expecting to hopefully come up as unscathed as possible from the process of scavenging for references on the subject.</p>\n\n<p>My main interests reside in the following areas:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Topology</li>\n<li>Geometry</li>\n<li>Analysis</li>\n<li>Set Theory</li>\n<li>Foundations of Mathematics</li>\n<li>Algebra</li>\n<li>Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Measure Theory</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>I also like music, and I'm a huge fan of guitarist John Frusciante.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>I have a blog, on which I post something every once in a millennium: <a href="http://aloiziomacedo.weebly.com/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://aloiziomacedo.weebly.com/</a></p>\n\n<p>I have a Real Analysis book in development (mostly done), which you can see <a href="http://bit.ly/2B2fUld" rel="nofollow noreferrer">here</a> (I've been adding some things, so the last sections are still incomplete).</p>\n\n<p>You can contact me at aloiziomacedo AT gmail DOT com.</p>\n	0	0	0	https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/c0cfbdd85dff4f07c26634e675dec02f?s=128&d=identicon&r=PG&f=1	\N	\N	528142
