3612	135	2015-09-01 17:29:01.987	Solenodon Paradoxus	2017-09-01 09:42:34.317	http://solenodonus.com	The Great Attractor, Laniakea supercluster	<p>Solenodon Paradoxus is one of the only two venomous mammal species on the planet. The other one is my evil twin brother, Solenodon Cubanus. According to <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venomous_mammal" rel="nofollow noreferrer">wikipedia</a>, we have significantly enlarged and granular submaxillary salivary glands from which the toxic saliva is produced.</p>\n\n<p>If you are self-studying fundamental physics, you should check out <a href="http://solenodonus.com" rel="nofollow noreferrer">my blog</a>. I try to keep balance, being relatively precise on one hand, while trying not to get carried away with unjustifiably complicated mathematics and focusing on the physical content instead - on the other. Comments and suggestions, as well as requests for a coverage of some specific topic are more than welcome :)</p>\n	2	12	0	https://i.stack.imgur.com/q5N0i.jpg?s=128&g=1	\N	\N	2861628
