4445	1	2016-07-18 13:50:17.323	Igor Dunaev	2016-07-18 13:50:17.323	https://www.facebook.com/GitShield/	Prague, Czech Republic	<p>The Second Renaissance project manager.</p>\n\n<p>The sum and bulk of what it's all about can be viewed here:</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://github.com/Cyberlusion" rel="nofollow">https://github.com/Cyberlusion</a></p>\n\n<p>and here</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/GitShield/" rel="nofollow">https://www.facebook.com/GitShield/</a></p>\n\n<p>Basically, I have a small team building and we're trying to create a technocratic society where scientists rule - not politicians. Due to the horrible state of our ecosystem our grandchildren might be the last generation before the next mass extinction. I'm trying to use all the funds available and all the technology available to restore the ecosystem and give men an edge through cyborization of the human body. This means a lot of investment into different technologies and projects.</p>\n\n<p>Bitcoin is a stepping stone for our society to finally change. Decentralization of both economy and political power can bring about a sustainable environment where green cities are controlled by computer algorithms, calculating everything to work in perfect synergy.</p>\n\n<p>The charity I would receive from you would obviously go towards monopolization of political power and economies. Bitcoins tend to "eat" fiat currency and I tend to use that against the banking system. The rate of return of investments ranges from 30% to 800%. The more money the project will have - the more it can make to become self-sustainable.</p>\n\n<p>At this stage even a single Bitcoin is great as I used to work as a stock market analyst and have been studying the market - my plan is solid but I need more backing since there simply is no time - hence why I hardly sleep. All my personal money is in the project - everything from cloud mining to currency exchange platforms and lending to other people to get commission back. It's ironic I'm behaving like a bank now but tough times deserve tough measures.</p>\n\n<p>Contact me if you would be interested in being part of the project - as an investor, a specialist in one of the fields or anyone else for that matter.</p>\n\n<p>Peace.</p>\n\n<p>Hope you see I'm trying to save us all here,</p>\n\n<p>Sincerely,</p>\n\n<p>Igor Dunaev</p>\n	0	0	0	https://graph.facebook.com/10153691157351500/picture?type=large	\N	\N	8816891
