4604	101	2016-09-23 02:15:08.317	Henry WH Hack v2.1.2	2018-02-08 20:49:03.5	https://stackexchange.com	Stack Exchange	<p><br>I am the ghost of Stack Exchange!</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>Current Version: v2.1.2<br>\nMajor Future Versions: Mod Edition,<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/http://stackoverflow.com/company/team#Community" rel="nofollow noreferrer">CM Edition</a> and <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/http://stackoverflow.com/company/team#Engineering" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Dev Edition</a></p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>I am <strong>trying</strong> to be as helpful as possible on the Stack Exchange network.</p>\n\n<p>Here are the tasks I do on the Stack Exchange sites (v2.1.2):</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>I cast votes on questions and answers.</li>\n<li>I flag bad post.</li>\n<li>I do edits on some SE sites.</li>\n<li>I do reviews on some SE sites. (First and Last Post/Close and Reopen (Private Betas) )</li>\n<li>I cast Close Votes on Area51.SE example questions that needs to be closed. (<strong>I was running out of ideas so why not.</strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Working on more ways to be helpful.</strong></p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><strong>Notes</strong>: </p>\n\n<p>If you have to make a complaint about me please do so in <a href="https://chat.stackexchange.com/rooms/51035"><strong>this</strong></a> chat room.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><strong>FAQ</strong>: </p>\n\n<p>Q: Why are you doing this?<br>\nA: It all started when <strike>I found out about Robert Cartaino</strike>, just kidding it happened long before that I just do them because, I am trying to be helpful. :)</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><a href="https://stackexchange.com/users/7238091">\n<img src="https://stackexchange.com/users/flair/7238091.png"></a></p>\n\n<p>RC ♦ is the man!  </p>\n\n<p><a href="https://stackexchange.com/users/34933">\n<img src="https://stackexchange.com/users/flair/34933.png"></a></p>\n\n<p>Dev Dev Dev! </p>\n\n<p><a href="https://stackexchange.com/users/37099">\n<img src="https://stackexchange.com/users/flair/37099.png"></a></p>\n\n<p>Shadow man!</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://stackexchange.com/users/620">\n<img src="https://stackexchange.com/users/flair/620.png"></a></p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><strong>Easter Eggs</strong>: </p>\n\n<p><sub>Count how many grammar mistakes are in my profile's about me page.</sub></p>\n	0	0	0	https://i.stack.imgur.com/ZsWaj.jpg?s=128&g=1	\N	\N	7238091
