5921	101	2018-02-16 21:00:01.503	Zoe	2018-06-26 14:55:00.02	https://lunarwatcher.github.io/	Troms, Norge	<p><strong><em>17 year old programmer</em></strong></p>\n\n<p><a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/ipGbL.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/ipGbL.png" alt="enter image description here"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/LDAUh.gif" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/LDAUh.gif" alt="score"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href="https://stackexchange.com/users/6473006">\n<img src="https://stackexchange.com/users/flair/6473006.png" width="208" height="58" alt="profile for Zoe on Stack Exchange, a network of free, community-driven Q&amp;A sites" title="profile for Zoe on Stack Exchange, a network of free, community-driven Q&amp;A sites">\n</a></p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><img src="https://media.giphy.com/media/26BRMtBncNuscdy2A/giphy.gif"></p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>I tried getting a life, but Gradle stopped me:</p>\n\n<pre><code>apply plugin: "life"\n</code></pre>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Plugin "life" not found</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><a href="https://data.stackexchange.com/stackoverflow/revision/822856/1015128/users-rank-in-a-location-with-min-rep-cap?repcap=100&amp;Location=Troms,%20Norge" rel="nofollow noreferrer">I'm the top user in my area</a> by reputation on Stack Overflow (I also happen to be the only one, lol)</p>\n\n<p>I mostly do Android development, though I know a lot of different programming languages. I use Python to create neural networks using TensorFlow from time to time too</p>\n\n<p>Some times I do some useful development (how useful is of course debatable), and other times I make useless stuff like <a href="https://github.com/LunarWatcher/Doge-git" rel="nofollow noreferrer">this</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Also, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iWtTSzULPWI" rel="nofollow noreferrer">I</a> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_23cEEEk_b8" rel="nofollow noreferrer">l</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=84CPo4bVkMk" rel="nofollow noreferrer">o</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BByMzI1YjKA" rel="nofollow noreferrer">v</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DT61L8hbbJ4" rel="nofollow noreferrer">e</a> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nfG2QA0H46M" rel="nofollow noreferrer">m</a><a href="https://open.spotify.com/track/5452S3WfTPDagZPfddDxEW?si=jOkYkFdCRGS06cATds15Yg" rel="nofollow noreferrer">u</a><a href="https://open.spotify.com/track/3k0yVg0bHHPJyRxwYVXN2P?si=4WQu8a2nRIKJAKCJp1_BHA" rel="nofollow noreferrer">s</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dCrLMwDz5qE" rel="nofollow noreferrer">i</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CFF0mV24WCY" rel="nofollow noreferrer">c</a>. (and yeah, every single letter in that sentence is a song URL). My playlist on Spotify has ~18 hours of music in it xD There's a lot of Japanese and Korean songs in there, though the majority is English. Some German stuff too. And there's a lot of different genres too.</p>\n\n<h2>List of languages I know</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Java</li>\n<li>Kotlin</li>\n<li>Scala</li>\n<li>Python</li>\n<li>Batch</li>\n<li>PHP</li>\n<li>JS</li>\n<li>C++</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Development (but not programming languages):</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>CSS</li>\n<li>HTML</li>\n<li>XML</li>\n<li>JSON</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Technologies:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Android</li>\n<li>Web</li>\n<li>Desktop</li>\n<li>Tensorflow</li>\n<li>Keras</li>\n<li>LibGDX</li>\n<li>OpenGL\n\n<ul>\n<li>LibGDX</li>\n<li>LWJGL</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li>Regex</li>\n<li>SQL (MySQL, SQLite)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Tools</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>VCS - Git</li>\n<li>IDE - Android Studio/PyCharm/IntelliJ (the IntelliJ based IDE's)</li>\n<li>Webdev IDE - Atom</li>\n<li>Visual Studio - C++</li>\n<li>Gradle</li>\n<li>CMake</li>\n</ul>\n	0	0	0	https://i.stack.imgur.com/EA5Zi.jpg?s=128&g=1	\N	\N	6473006
