5935	1	2018-02-22 17:45:46.113	Josh	2018-02-23 01:05:39.393	http://www.vaporfaith.com/	Broomfield, CO, USA	<p>Coding: Self-taught, entry-level coder. I am proficient in HTML5, CSS3 and know a little JavaScript and LUA.</p>\n\n<p>I enjoy coding and do it often. I maintain my own website, which I built from the ground up years ago and work constantly to improve it any way I can. I recently gave it a fresh coat of paint and made it responsive, but there is much work yet to do.</p>\n\n<p>I love to create. I'm a gamer at heart, however, I spend most of my game time designing missions. I probably spend 85% of my game time in a mission-building capacity and 15% actually playing. That's where I picked up some LUA. I have a master's degree in journalism (photojournalism track) from the University of Texas at Austin, but would love to explore the world of coding more deeply.</p>\n\n<p>Interests: I have a passion for aviation. I also love photography, producing videos, any kind of data analysis and writing (ask me about AP Style). I am a knowledgeable sports fan, follow team sports and motorsports closely and frequently hit the Avs and Rockies games. I catch Rapids games when I can and when the mountains have snow, I can be found riding my snowboard. Look for me in the terrain park. Beyond sports, aviation and digital media, I am a poker enthusiast and do a fair bit of reading (almost exclusively biographies, but always nonfiction).</p>\n	0	0	0	https://i.stack.imgur.com/MMgSa.jpg?s=128&g=1	\N	\N	13001872
